  "description": "The easiest way to send Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) push notifications from .NET with the FCM HTTP v1 API: service-account or Application Default Credentials, a fluent message builder for Android, iOS (APNs) and web push, token, topic and condition targets, multicast with invalid-token reporting, retries, and one-line dependency injection setup.",
